{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18126","headline":"南溪始泛三首 二 · 韩愈","name":"南溪始泛三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南溪亦清驶，而无檝与舟。\n山农惊见之，随我观不休。\n不惟儿童辈，或有杖白头。\n馈我笼中瓜，劝我此淹留。\n我云以病归，此已颇自由。\n幸有用余俸，置居在西畴。\n囷仓米谷满，未有旦夕忧。\n上去无得得，下来亦悠悠。\n但恐烦里闾，时有缓急投。\n愿爲同社人，鸡豚燕春秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}